{"4136460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blux", "steam_appid": 4136460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to be a gooey ball of destruction with a fashion sense? Meet the Blobbys — your squishy, shooty, skill-slinging slime in a procedural generated world that never ends (just like our bad game-design decisions). Loot, level up, wear ridiculous hats, and blast your way through a story that’s almost as absurd as your aim. Bring friends. Or don’t. A Blobby doesn’t judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/bad216f36a12e3c3d5f8c3e73f6e82d9.poster.avif?t=1780421499\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/bad216f36a12e3c3d5f8c3e73f6e82d9.webm?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/bad216f36a12e3c3d5f8c3e73f6e82d9.mp4?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a blend between a 3rd person bullet hell shooter and a rougelite mixed with RPG elements. Your main objective: Bring Grandma Blobby back her precious magic stick. On your journey, you explore a procedural generated world filled with countless monsters - each of which possesses unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/06ada4967a7f97a6db84e5f65a3031b8.poster.avif?t=1780421499\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/06ada4967a7f97a6db84e5f65a3031b8.webm?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/06ada4967a7f97a6db84e5f65a3031b8.mp4?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to collect them all and use them to your advantage. The skill system allows you to combine these abilities to create deadly bullet combinations and unleash a barrage of bullets and chaos upon your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/ad34962c34a3a8e6bf5dc2754d07c1f4.poster.avif?t=1780421499\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/ad34962c34a3a8e6bf5dc2754d07c1f4.webm?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/ad34962c34a3a8e6bf5dc2754d07c1f4.mp4?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fresh outfits and customize your Blobby with countless skins to fit your style. Enjoy this handcrafted experience alone or invite your friends to hot coop sessions for even more action.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to be a gooey ball of destruction with a fashion sense? Meet the Blobbys — your squishy, shooty, skill-slinging slime in a procedural generated world that never ends (just like our bad game-design decisions). Loot, level up, wear ridiculous hats, and blast your way through a story that’s almost as absurd as your aim. Bring friends. Or don’t. A Blobby doesn’t judge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/bad216f36a12e3c3d5f8c3e73f6e82d9.poster.avif?t=1780421499\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/bad216f36a12e3c3d5f8c3e73f6e82d9.webm?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/bad216f36a12e3c3d5f8c3e73f6e82d9.mp4?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a blend between a 3rd person bullet hell shooter and a rougelite mixed with RPG elements. Your main objective: Bring Grandma Blobby back her precious magic stick. On your journey, you explore a procedural generated world filled with countless monsters - each of which possesses unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/06ada4967a7f97a6db84e5f65a3031b8.poster.avif?t=1780421499\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/06ada4967a7f97a6db84e5f65a3031b8.webm?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/06ada4967a7f97a6db84e5f65a3031b8.mp4?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to collect them all and use them to your advantage. The skill system allows you to combine these abilities to create deadly bullet combinations and unleash a barrage of bullets and chaos upon your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/ad34962c34a3a8e6bf5dc2754d07c1f4.poster.avif?t=1780421499\" width=432 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/ad34962c34a3a8e6bf5dc2754d07c1f4.webm?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/extras/ad34962c34a3a8e6bf5dc2754d07c1f4.mp4?t=1780421499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fresh outfits and customize your Blobby with countless skins to fit your style. Enjoy this handcrafted experience alone or invite your friends to hot coop sessions for even more action.</p>", "short_description": "Engage in a non epic adventure of slimy goodness - Shoot, loot and level up your skills! Create your own weapons and play style by combining the heck out of all these skills we were too lazy to balance properly.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/f6fdbba927b87a7f1c659a081e9d2d508d57c56c/header.jpg?t=1780421499", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/3359f20d8a717980d379c337653f77e647738e37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780421499", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136460/3359f20d8a717980d379c337653f77e647738e37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780421499", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit / Windows 11 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3-3225 / AMD A10-7850K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750Ti(2GB) / AMD Radeon R7 370(2GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Does really anybody know the model of his own soundcard?</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 12 128bit<br></li><li><strong>